  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secretariat for the Okavango Basin Commission     OKACOM Secretariat - OKACOM Secr evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekretariatet f&#xf6;r Okavangos flodkommission        OKACOM Sekretariatet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida st&#xf6;djer under 3 &#xe5;r (2007-2010) uppr&#xe4;ttandet av ett sekretariat   till samarbetsorganisationen kring Okavangofloden: OKACOM (Okavango   River Basin Commission). Sekreteriatet agerar p&#xe5; uppdrag av           medlemsl&#xe4;nderna genom OKACOM. Faciliterar, koordinerar, st&#xf6;djer       initiativ och har en kommunikationskomponent.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Okavango River Basin is shared by Angola, Botswana and Namibia.   The Permanent Okavango River Basin Water Commission (OKACOM),         established in 1994, has decided to establish a permanent Secretariat in order to co-ordinate present and future activities. Sida provides  support to the Secretariat with SEK 16.7 million during 2007 - 2010,  and SEK 300 000 to reveiws and evaluations.</narrative>
  </description>
